g11-audio-4-1
00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:08.760
Unit 4, Globalization of food.

g11-audio-4-2
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.780
Here are the advantages and disadvantages of fast food worth considering.

g11-audio-4-3
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.880
First, I'll tell you the advantages of eating fast food.

g11-audio-4-4
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.080
1. It's fast.

g11-audio-4-5
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.620
A primary reason for the popularity of fast food is that it's fast as its name suggests.

g11-audio-4-6
00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:27.980
People live busy lives.

g11-audio-4-7
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:32.620
Preparing our own food might sound nice, but it isn't always possible.

g11-audio-4-8
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:37.860
1. Going to the local fast food restaurant, you can satisfy your hunger in a few minutes.

g11-audio-4-9
00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:40.200
2. It's delicious.

g11-audio-4-10
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.460
Fast food normally tastes very good.

g11-audio-4-11
00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:50.380
It may not be the best food, but it isn't that bad either, especially if you consider the time it took to make and the price that you

g11-audio-4-12
00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.080
paid for it.

g11-audio-4-13
00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.420
3. It's reasonable.

g11-audio-4-14
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.360
Fast food chains offer a meal out at affordable prices.

g11-audio-4-15
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.560
You can go and enjoy some fast food without costing you much.

g11-audio-4-16
00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.400
4. It is not as bad as many people think.

g11-audio-4-17
00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.460
More and more fast food chains are offering healthier options.

g11-audio-4-18
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.640
They try to consider the needs of increasingly health-conscious audience.

g11-audio-4-19
00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.280
You will find some healthy options on the fast food menus these days.

g11-audio-4-20
00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:25.060
In some countries, you can get burgers that look and taste exactly like beef, chicken and lobster made from plants.

g11-audio-4-21
00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:28.420
Here are the disadvantages of fast food.

g11-audio-4-22
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.780
1. It's unhealthy.

g11-audio-4-23
00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:35.160
All of us will agree that eating from fast food restaurants is unhealthy.

g11-audio-4-24
00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:41.120
The saturated fat, added sugar, salt and additives are all said to be bad for our health.

g11-audio-4-25
00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:46.300
If you have decided to eat fast food, it's best not to eat too much of it.

g11-audio-4-26
00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.320
It's best to avoid it.

g11-audio-4-27
00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:51.320
2. It can make you feel sick.

g11-audio-4-28
00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:56.280
You might feel a bit sick after eating fast food, which contains a lot of fat,

g11-audio-4-29
00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:01.780
sugar, sugar, grease and salt, especially when you eat more than your body really needs and you suffer the consequences.

g11-audio-4-30
00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.540
3. It's addictive.

g11-audio-4-31
00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:07.360
Eating fast food can be addictive.

g11-audio-4-32
00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.280
The more you eat it, the harder it is to avoid eating it.

g11-audio-4-33
00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:16.380
And, like any addiction, you'll want to eat it too often, which could lead to many health problems.

g11-audio-4-34
00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.380
You might spend a lot of money on it too.

g11-audio-4-35
00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:24.280
The food may be cheap, but if you're buying it all the time the cost is going to add up.

g11-audio-4-36
00:02:25.480 --> 00:02:28.820
4. It makes family spend less and less time together.

g11-audio-4-37
00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:35.800
Family meal time is something that is considered as an opportunity for all the members to come together and share their experiences.

g11-audio-4-38
00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:41.480
However, eating at fast food restaurants is quickly taking away the quality time of families.

g11-audio-4-39
00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:48.940
You should, therefore, learn to choose fast food carefully and remember the pleasure of eating good food in good company.
